{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "7fa2e8e804f48c3ac1ab90c9817cc318faa8730cfb6622e67c454c99e1e26b09", "ja": "ハジけた後は……", "zh": "嗨完之后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ffb0ccf23862028d8f1d6f7d87f1d83f434ad241b4e9138b79d9cb9474f11b29", "ja": "打ち上げでエステにやってきた一同。莉緒の\nオススメで各自に合った施術を堪能し、疲れ\nを癒やすことに。失恋しても人は綺麗になる\nのかもしれないと、足ツボを襲う痛みに絶叫\nしつつ、プロデューサーは思うのだった。", "zh": "庆功宴后，大家一起来到了美容院。在莉绪的推荐下，众人享受了适合自己的护理，决定借此消除疲劳。  \n“就算失恋，人或许也会变得更漂亮吧。”制作人一边因袭向脚底穴位的疼痛而惨叫，一边这样想着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "139c2a713709f1ad18e1ec4f489126f285f838933e2a51b87a7d8d91ce8fa5b0", "ja": "（ダイヤチームのツアー公演は、今回も大成功！\n今日の打ち上げは、莉緒が企画したというが……）", "zh": "（钻石队的巡演公演这次也大获成功！今天的庆功会听说是莉绪策划的，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c22b1968b011c2a1e136ce7e5934eeab460635b44b2d1d805aa3a471343624f0", "ja": "こ、ここがエステ……！\nすごく、オシャレです……！", "zh": "这、这里就是美容院……！\n好、好时髦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bfccb7a01cfd1eb5f917abec2c1a57ac3e998809eb3ce49d90bfc7a346a327d5", "ja": "今日は、今回の公演の打ち上げって\n聞いたけど……どうしてエステなんだ？", "zh": "听说今天是这次公演的庆功会……可为什么会来美容院？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "53e0c7f8f55850c374084c18a4514930f8b3b201e43ee65c5cba4271522ba70e", "ja": "そんなの、決まってるじゃない！\n海辺の合宿に、南エリアへのツアー……。", "zh": "那还用说嘛，当然是有原因的！\n海边集训，还有去南部地区的巡演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "da6285af6f3937e82cf66e80f7638892cf7c38db64f4a5c9258492ad986c7d1d", "ja": "強い日差しで、乙女の肌がピンチなのよ～！", "zh": "强烈的日晒让少女的肌肤陷入危机了啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "b721b94d5ee583f53e168cf9300792a025ee45da0e6cff36ee2215e3c651debd", "ja": "私も、日焼け止めは塗ってましたけど……ちゃんと\nケアしたほうがいいって、莉緒さんに聞いて。", "zh": "我也涂了防晒霜，不过……听莉绪姐说，还是好好护理比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "e3c5804d47107903abaa8e7e4cd01cffddd9683c2137b349f2f6965b00523bb4", "ja": "それにエステって、なんか面白そうじゃない？\nね、琴葉お姉ちゃん♪", "zh": "而且美容院什么的，感觉也挺有意思的，不是吗？\n对吧，琴叶姐姐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "98a8b16b57d597f6291aea297865b09296b0911439379b6ff8f71c91c1d7711d", "ja": "う、うん。……あの、がんばって\n綺麗になりますので！　よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "嗯、嗯。……那个，我会努力\n变漂亮的！　请多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "1ab72c610bb2ba96ba42e80b62ebf2132adf441641b190d65abc651a3fa21a05", "ja": "真美、エステでせくしー美女になって、\n兄ちゃんをメロメロにしちゃうかんね！　うっふ～ん♪", "zh": "真美要去美容院变成性感美女，然后把哥哥迷得神魂颠倒！哎呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a1fccf5f0fe46c91c981d9264e0bceb07169c94039a29593369bae893ab358cb", "ja": "そういう事だったのか……\nみんながいいなら、もちろん構わないよ。", "zh": "原来是这么回事……\n只要大家都愿意，我当然没意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "3f0329fb0c41bf149291f13caaad1aee80d54a97a28da9780317b4b00367c66d", "ja": "よかった！　それじゃみんな、好きなコースを\n選んで？　思いっきり、リラックスしましょ♪", "zh": "太好了！那大家就选自己喜欢的\n套餐吧？尽情地放松一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "576f4b99626f5872b8cc52d1a806855e38f6304c285f126f27d472e8afce5e58", "ja": "私は、アーユルヴェーダをお願いします。\n前から、すこし興味があって……。", "zh": "我要阿育吠陀。之前就有点感兴趣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "400271d8a572167ade1f17421a32ca22014391e1c45360e8a9689f2bbefc670f", "ja": "いいわね！　温かいオイルが気持ちいいのよね～。", "zh": "挺好的呀！暖暖的精油可舒服了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "29a2100c7687de7a0d4b40171436f22a816fa8b61cdb74b1dc326c729ed48617", "ja": "真美はねー、この海藻パックにしよっかなー！\nお肌がとぅるんとぅるんになりそうだし！", "zh": "真美想选这个海藻面膜呢——！\n感觉皮肤会变得水嫩嫩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "6cf9488a054368b2fa4d3b045067617b4e2d2bdbbcc5f315b2ea73a9186cedd4", "ja": "真美ちゃんなら、何もしなくてもお肌ツルツルだと\n思うけど……そうね、興味のあるものが一番よ！", "zh": "真美的话，我觉得就算什么都不做，皮肤也会很光滑……不过，还是选自己感兴趣的最好哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1015_womanstaff", "source_sha256": "691254c6790ae658397339b551c400888ba18fd561efafaf631ac2eab78bbc91", "ja": "かしこまりました、ご案内いたします！", "zh": "好的，这就为您介绍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "832723d77b2b27d7ec9398ba3be3afdc0df875cf3668ae3dfe00acf8428ce80a", "ja": "わ、私は……ええっと、どうしよう……。\n莉緒さん、オススメとかありますか？", "zh": "我、我……那个，该怎么办好呢……\n莉绪小姐，您有什么推荐的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "059cccdb634920173a0ac505fcff69f8de60fe326469fe91c1e6d28328483467", "ja": "そうね、雪歩ちゃんなら……この、ハーブを使った\nデトックスなんていいんじゃないかしら？", "zh": "嗯，要是雪步的话……这个用香草做的排毒护理，不是挺合适的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1018_004yuk", "source_sha256": "8127181843574c1fd80b56b2446fc32d5db0924725b3df8be884108f92a2aa4a", "ja": "ハーブを使った……いい香りがしそう。\n私、それにしますね！", "zh": "用香草做的……闻起来应该会很香。\n我就选这个吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "1e78639132ba518fadd12c65a521c2ff33ca48e81658f18dfc5daa2575d69127", "ja": "じゃあ終わったら、またここに集合ね♪", "zh": "那结束后，大家再到这里集合哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d5e7f5f82952f99a5c9de91258b67b693ddb011f100c0247efb88fef0d8913fe", "ja": "はいっ！　それじゃ、いってきます……！", "zh": "好的！那我出发了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1e157ffbcfbc4d2cb73ef2e8d4d515728a61b7d4c0ca4ba8346ce5e61b6c1878", "ja": "莉緒は、どれにするんだ？", "zh": "莉緒，你要选哪个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "2d413ecbc8d2cfded4e357e8e54a3c1cc93b96fb3c8cf3b55d996c5fa6e36f6c", "ja": "それが、迷ってるのよね～。疲れも取りたいけど、\n日焼けした肌もケアしたいし……。", "zh": "这个嘛，我正在纠结呢～。既想消除疲劳，也想护理晒黑的肌肤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "f74062c1f1303e77a04c6170492af22d93c1c6ac2881b14e79d9fffa197342e5", "ja": "あ、{$P$}くんはどうする？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}你打算怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1024_womanstaff", "source_sha256": "c8ec4346c5748e9ae425aac71d8d5a2e3d9130e6cca30aa6f1ef1b8595186616", "ja": "彼氏さんも、百瀬さんと一緒に施術なさいますか？\n同じ部屋にする事もできますよ！", "zh": "男朋友也要和百濑小姐一起做护理吗？\n也可以安排在同一个房间哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "01c816f1da166dc48c171e38d259e73673755655ad6bde4a54466bdd18aedd76", "ja": "ち、違うのよ～！　この人は彼氏じゃなくて、\n仕事の同僚っていうか……ね！", "zh": "不、不是啦～！这个人不是男朋友，而是工作上的同事……怎么说呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "2d59357ac2b434c9ca133917900569c207a757bc134e9f6cc89c0ad0ae5ffd3a", "ja": "莉緒、そんなに慌てなくても……。", "zh": "莉绪，不用这么慌张吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1028_046rio", "source_sha256": "49edb1bd1289071dec3abe17245b7a0eecff9bee002375dc6cb4c03b116a6643", "ja": "あ、慌ててないわよ！　その、私たちの関係を\nなんて説明すればいいのか迷っちゃっただけで……。", "zh": "啊，我、我才没慌呢！只是……我在犹豫该怎么说明我们之间的关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1029_p", "source_sha256": "583dfc0b8021ab065bfc6079dcabb25110fa74505fa39df3e736082b231598d7", "ja": "いや、アイドルとプロデューサーじゃ……。", "zh": "不，不就是偶像和制作人吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "80019f7da6b90906cfdea2d3dcb207033169e1c106a3171151baeef58a6e3b75", "ja": "そうだけど……あー、もう！　すみません、この人に\n疲労回復マッサージコースを！　すっごく痛いヤツ！", "zh": "是这样没错……啊——真是的！不好意思，给这个人来个消除疲劳的按摩套餐！要特别痛的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3a33ed337a97352b5a048ae8bba2ddb23a49b218536b1a4c9289784f8c1acf1b", "ja": "えっ！？　莉緒、だから俺は……。", "zh": "诶！？莉绪，所以我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "80edbb2250f395e89665ec505de1331ac727b880ab14d17081b1d1866c50fa84", "ja": "だって{$P$}くん、いつも仕事\nばっかりじゃない。たまには骨休めしなきゃ。", "zh": "可是{$P$}，你总是只顾着工作。偶尔也得好好休息一下才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1033_046rio", "source_sha256": "c96eb859bc7714119e41f177a87da6574e9d4026a6c77ba60c0633c77aba67ef", "ja": "しっかりデトックスして、気持ちを切り替える！\n今回の新曲だって、そういうテーマだったでしょ？", "zh": "好好排排毒，转换一下心情！\n这次的新歌也是以这个为主题的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1034_p", "source_sha256": "bd56f188ccbcc407fd6661831a3bbc8c6e8c76ad026c593d42760e96cfd5c3cd", "ja": "そうだな……わかったよ。\nじゃあ、俺も施術してもらおうかな。", "zh": "是啊……我明白了。\n那我也接受护理吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "61c7651142b1b69b2b15eef02e4c354faa84427a67a3a82d1473d7137e6863e5", "ja": "そうこなくっちゃ！\n私は……この、『特盛ラグジュアリーコース』で！", "zh": "就是这样！\n我要……这个“超豪华加量套餐”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0198_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0198_story_07_1036_046rio", "source_sha256": "164498f6b96d8ba7004eed9f03043af0de4b20edf1b4c2d3144abb7bcea2317f", "ja": "また後でね、{$P$}くん。\nキレイになった私に、見惚れちゃダメよ？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "待会儿见，{$P$}君。\n可别看着变漂亮的我入迷哦？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
